{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1511758-signs-of-sorcery-requisitions-question","id":1511758,"title":"Signs of Sorcery, Requisitions Question","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Mage: The Awakening"],"posts":[{"date":"2023-05-15T18:46:55-07:00","id":1511758,"title":"Signs of Sorcery, Requisitions Question","content":"Hello, I noticed that the availability rating of certain requisitions change based on certain factors, such as a +1 availability rating to Mentor if it's infamous, or a +1 to Library if it's Advanced. However, my question is, since these are different merits how does this work? <br /> <br /> Ex: Let's say I have 5 dots of Order Status, and I requisition a permanent Mentor, I can get a 3 dot version of that Mentor permanently. Could I then get the permanent Infamous Mentor Merit as a secondary requisition for 2 dots (as the availability rating has gone up by +1, meaning I can only requisition 2 dots of Infamous Mentor) OR is it the same requisition, and therefore I could requisition an Infamous Mentor getting both Infamous Mentor and Mentor at 2 dots? A similar question arises with Advanced Library, am I making one requisition for Library and get the Advanced version equal to the dots of Library I requisition and the availability rating increases for that ONE requisition, or do I requisition Library with no changes in availability, then can requisition Advanced Library with a +1 availability rating. <br /> <br /> Any clarification would be greatly appreciated, however the second option, in which two requisitions are made seems the most likely.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26413-thatonekiasyd","name":"ThatOneKiasyd","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26413_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"35"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-05-15T19:08:09-07:00","id":1511760,"title":"","content":"My reading would be that it's one requisition for the same rating, because it makes no narrative sense whatsoever to be able to requisition infamy onto your existing Mentor and there would, for instance, be a separate line in the chart for Sanctum and Safe Place if you were supposed to be able to requisition Merits that rely on other Merits in this way but it would likewise be prohibitively expensive for a temporary requisition of a Demesne to have a baseline Availability of 6.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-05-15T19:31:20-07:00","id":1511762,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Satchel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1511758-signs-of-sorcery-requisitions-question?p=1511760#post1511760\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">My reading would be that it's one requisition for the same rating, because it makes no narrative sense whatsoever to be able to requisition infamy onto your existing Mentor and there would, for instance, be a separate line in the chart for Sanctum and Safe Place if you were supposed to be able to requisition Merits that rely on other Merits in this way but it would likewise be prohibitively expensive for a temporary requisition of a Demesne to have a baseline Availability of 6.</div> </div> </div> </div>I tend to agree, however I find it strange as then you wouldn't be able to requisition Advanced Library to 5? As Library only goes to three, so then you either get Advanced Library at 3 max, even though it is up to a 5 dot merit or perhaps the intent is that you could requisition more with no added benefit to Library and it would only affect Advanced Library. (Ex: Temporarily requisition Library 4 with Advanced Library for a total of 5 availability rating, thus giving Library 3 and Advanced Library 4?)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26413-thatonekiasyd","name":"ThatOneKiasyd","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26413_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"35"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-05-15T20:06:20-07:00","id":1511764,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ThatOneKiasyd</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1511758-signs-of-sorcery-requisitions-question?p=1511762#post1511762\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I tend to agree, however I find it strange as then you wouldn't be able to requisition Advanced Library to 5? As Library only goes to three, so then you either get Advanced Library at 3 max, even though it is up to a 5 dot merit or perhaps the intent is that you could requisition more with no added benefit to Library and it would only affect Advanced Library. (Ex: Temporarily requisition Library 4 with Advanced Library for a total of 5 availability rating, thus giving Library 3 and Advanced Library 4?)</div> </div> </div> </div>Advanced Library is doubly tricky because it <i>also</i> has a prerequisite of an equal level of Safe Place, but that in turn indicates to me that there's no issue in requisitioning access to an Advanced Library with more dots than it's possible to have in a regular Library because you're still getting a Safe Place out of the deal.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}